    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n101016" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συντηκ-τικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>able to liquefy</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἁλμυρὸν ς. γλώττης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>de An.</u>
					422a19
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Somn.Vig.</u>
				456b35
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Resp.</u>
				479b21
			</span></i>; <i>liquefactive</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φάρμακα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					11.757
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> (from 
				Pass.
			) <i>easily liquefied</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				622a15
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>wasting</i>, of sick persons, <i><span class="en">
				Aret.
				<u>SD</u>
				1.13
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plin.
				<u>HN</u>
				28.125
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυρετὸς ς</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				18(2).42
			</span></i>.</div>
